---
// How ATO / ATC periodic call auction picks ONE clearing price:
// Cumulative buy volume vs cumulative sell volume -> maximize matched volume.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 330;

const ROWS = [
  { p: '25,200', buy: '1,000 (ATO)', sell: '6,500', match: '1,000', best: false },
  { p: '25,100', buy: '2,500', sell: '5,000', match: '2,500', best: false },
  { p: '25,000', buy: '4,500', sell: '4,200', match: '4,200', best: true },
  { p: '24,900', buy: '6,000', sell: '2,000', match: '2,000', best: false },
] as const;
---
<figure class="sbp3-auc">
  <div class="sbp3-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="ATO/ATC auction price table: at 25,000 VND, cumulative buy demand is 4,500 shares and cumulative sell supply is 4,200 shares, maximizing matched volume at 4,200 shares.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp3-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>How ATO / ATC picks one single price: maximum matched volume wins</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Phiên ATO / ATC chọn một mức giá duy nhất thế nào: nơi khớp được nhiều nhất sẽ thắng</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Table headers */}
      <rect x="20" y="52" width="540" height="40" rx="6" class="sbp3-th-bg" />
      <text x="90" y="77" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-th">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Candidate price</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mức giá thử</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="225" y="77" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-th">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Cum. Buy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mua lũy kế</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="360" y="77" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-th">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Cum. Sell</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bán lũy kế</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="77" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-th">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Matched</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khớp được</tspan>
      </text>

      {ROWS.map((r, idx) => {
        const y = 100 + idx * 46;
        return (
          <g>
            <rect
              x="20"
              y={y}
              width="540"
              height="40"
              rx="6"
              class={r.best ? 'sbp3-row sbp3-row-red' : 'sbp3-row'}
            />
            <text x="90" y={y + 25} text-anchor="middle" class={r.best ? 'sbp3-val sbp3-red' : 'sbp3-val'}>{r.p}</text>
            <text x="225" y={y + 25} text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-body">{r.buy}</text>
            <text x="360" y={y + 25} text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-body">{r.sell}</text>
            <text x="490" y={y + 25} text-anchor="middle" class={r.best ? 'sbp3-val sbp3-red' : 'sbp3-val'}>{r.match}</text>
          </g>
        );
      })}

      {/* Right explanation card */}
      <rect x="586" y="52" width="294" height="226" rx="10" class="sbp3-card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="scale" x={616} y={84} size={26} />
      <text x="642" y="89" class="sbp3-th">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Why 25,000 VND clears</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Vì sao chốt tại 25.000 đồng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="606" y="130" class="sbp3-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• 4,200 is the highest matched volume</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• 4.200 CP là khối lượng khớp lớn nhất</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="606" y="160" class="sbp3-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• ATO/ATC orders fill before LO at 25,000</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Lệnh ATO/ATC được ưu tiên trước LO 25.000</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="606" y="190" class="sbp3-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Remaining 300 buy @ 25k stay unfilled</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• 300 CP mua còn dư ở 25k không khớp hết</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="606" y="220" class="sbp3-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Unfilled ATO cancels at 09:15; ATC at 14:45</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• ATO dư hủy lúc 09:15; ATC hủy lúc 14:45</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>During ATO and ATC, nobody matches immediately. Orders accumulate for 15 minutes, and at the bell the exchange picks the single price where cumulative buy demand and cumulative sell supply produce the largest matched volume.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trong 15 phút ATO và ATC, lệnh chưa khớp ngay mà gom lại chờ cuối phiên. Lúc hết giờ, sàn tìm ra đúng một mức giá cho khối lượng khớp lớn nhất giữa lượng mua lũy kế và bán lũy kế.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp3-auc { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp3-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp3-auc svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp3-auc text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp3-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp3-th-bg { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .sbp3-th { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp3-row { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .sbp3-row-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp3-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp3-val { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp3-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp3-body { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .sbp3-sub { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp3-auc figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
